          <li><a href="#q2">Question 2 — "From what date can [Person] return for [T] days?"</a></li>
          <li><a href="#q3">Question 3 — "On what date must [Person] exit?"</a></li>
          <li><a href="#q4">Question 4 — "Can [Person] re-enter on [D] for [T] days?"</a></li>
          <li><a href="#q5">Question 5 — Coordinating trips</a></li>
