        This is the planning question — someone who already knows roughly
        how long they want their next trip to be and is trying to figure
        out when they can book it. It's harder than Question 1 because the
        correct date usually isn't "wait until everything clears" — it's
        the earliest point where <em>enough</em> allowance exists for a
        trip of that specific length, which can be well before the full
        90 days are back. This is exactly the situation Anna is in in
        <a href="/blog/the-schengen-90-180-rolling-window#case-3">Case 3 of
