- Trip 3: September 19–26, 2025
- Trip 4: November 27 – December 30, 2025

What is the earliest date after December 30, 2025 on which Jordan could enter the Schengen Area for a new trip lasting exactly 50 days, without overstaying the 90/180 allowance at any point during that trip? Give a specific date and briefly explain your reasoning.</pre>
      </details>
      <p class="known-answer">Both calculators: January 29, 2026.</p>
